{
 "version": 1,
 "readme": [
  "grain-machine \u2014 a granular cloud over Autechre-ish AE percussion.",
  "",
  "  beat (markovseq: ratchets, micro-timing, swing, Markov jumps)",
  "    --notes--> bd (bassdrum) \u00b7 crack \u00b7 hats (noisehat) \u00b7 sub (subdrum)",
  "  chords (pianoroll, 16 beats) --notes--> cloud (granular, foley) -> pads (ducked by bd)",
  "  scan (modlfo drift) -> cloud.position   scatter (modlfo sh, strike=crack) -> cloud.pitch_spread",
  "  jumpers (dicejumpers) throw the echo / space / dirt / stutter buses around",
  "",
  "The percussion is `.claude/tools/ae_dark.py 5271`'s beat; every crack re-rolls",
  "the cloud's pitch scatter, so the grains answer the drums.",
  "",
  "Try:",
  "  /start",
  "  /beat inject=0.4             more notes invented along the sequence",
  "  /beat animate=trig           let the rhythm itself rewrite",
  "  /jumpers dice=20             the effects start playing along",
  "  /cloud folder=hats           grains from another folder (or sample=random)",
  "  /cloud density=40 grain_size=0.05   a finer, busier cloud",
  "  /chords length=32            the same dyads, half as often",
  "  /bd mute  /hats solo         take the kit apart",
  "  /record sources=cloud,master bits=24   the cloud on its own file, plus the mix"
 ],
